; FIND inside corner, the back left corner of a pocket (walls on the corner's
; X- and Y+ sides). Start above the surrounding top outside the pocket,
; diagonally beyond the corner, less than step-off #3023 from each wall
; line, within #3020 of the top. Touches the top, steps diagonally into the
; pocket, plunges, touches the X wall (moving X-) and the Y wall (moving
; Y+), and ends over the corner at the clearance plane. With #3030 = 0
; the active work offset gets X0 Y0 at the corner and Z0 at the top. See
; ferrum_inside_corner.
o<probe_back_left_inside_corner> sub
o10 if [#<_task> EQ 0]
    o<probe_back_left_inside_corner> return
o10 endif
o<ferrum_inside_corner> call [-1] [1]
o<probe_back_left_inside_corner> endsub
M2
